{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《Percent Calculators》是一款專為日常百分比運算而設的 iOS 工具，無論核對帳單、計算折扣或整理報表數據，都能快速得出答案。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，適合學生、上班族及需要經常換算比例的人士下載。</p>\n\n<h2>五種常用百分比計算模式</h2>\n<p>《Percent Calculators》源自百分比資訊網站的讀者需求，主打直覺、簡潔與快速操作。內建五種模式：計算某數的百分比、兩數之間的百分比變化、某數佔另一數的比例，以及加上或減去指定百分比。介面簡潔無多餘裝飾，開啟即可輸入數字得出結果，適合學生核對功課、上班族處理報表或購物換算折扣。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-119-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-120-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-121-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-122-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-123-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-124-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Percent Calculators</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-15T04:40:49.408323+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":328,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}